    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d181">

                <pb facs="0175" n="165" sameAs="frus:frus1937v05/pg165"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">810.34 Leasing/113</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Argentina</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Weddell</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary
                        of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 1711</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Buenos
                                Aires</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1937-08-20"
                            >August 20, 1937</date>.<lb/>[Received August 30.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: With reference to my telegram No. 145 of
                    August 20, 5 p.m., I have the honor to enclose herewith a translation of a <hi
                        rendition="#italic">pro-memoria</hi> handed me on August 19 by the Argentine
                    Minister for Foreign Affairs on the destroyer question. As careful a translation
                    as possible has been made of a rather vague and disconnected document.</p>
                <p>Respectfully yours,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Alexander W.
                    Weddell</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d181-a1.xml" xpointer="d181-a1"/>
